{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40040","label":"BOOMS DAY"},"label":"The Day the Truth Crumbled","stage":null,"prev":"event_boomsday_03_e","next":"event_boomsday_04_s","speakers":{"trony":"Trony","boy":"Boy","girl02":"Girl","adultwoman":"Adult Woman","adultman":"Adult Man"},"icons":{"trony":"si_c501_00_s","adultwoman":"si_c912_00_s","adultman":"si_c911_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_1","text":"Once, there was a girl.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Park","bgArt":"park","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_2","text":"My dream is to look at the sky!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_inwonderland","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_3","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_3","text":"Whenever the precocious Trony spoke of her dreams, the other kids were always puzzled.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["girl02","boy"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"boy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_4","text":"What kind of dream is that? If you wanna look at the sky, all you've gotta do is lift your head up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"boy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_5","text":"If you ask me, you've already achieved your dream.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_6","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_6","text":"And when they asked her these questions, Trony would reply.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_7","text":"The sky above us isn't the real thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_8","text":"The real sky is much higher up, and much more vast.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_9","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_9","text":"The sniggering laughter became louder.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"girl02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_10","text":"Don't be such a weirdo, Trony.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"girl02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_11","text":"If this isn't the real sky, then what's the real one like?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_12","text":"It's what lies above all those amazing places we've heard about in stories.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_13","text":"The open sea, erupting volcanoes and everything else waiting for us up on the surface...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"trony","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_14","text":"above it all, is the real, true sky.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"boy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_15","text":"So your dream is to go up to the surface and get torn apart by Raptures?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_16","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_16","text":"Her friends laughed at her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"boy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_17","text":"You're such an idiot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_18","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_18","text":"As time passed, her friends would hurl more vicious insults at her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_19","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_19","text":"And every time they did,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_20","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_20","text":"Trony would fantasize about how one day, someone would believe her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_21","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_21","text":"That one day, the truth would come to light.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_22","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_22","text":"No matter how much her friends made fun of her, Trony never stopped telling them about her dream.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_23","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_23","text":"However, things rarely happen according to our plans,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_24","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_24","text":"and Trony's dream would soon take an unexpected turn.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["adultwoman","adultman"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"adultwoman","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_25","text":"Apparently, we're supposed to be able to see something unusual in the sky today.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"adultman","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_26","text":"Yeah, I wonder what it could be.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_27","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_27","text":"On a day when many citizens had gathered in the square,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Park_n","bgArt":"park_n","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_28","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_28","text":"\"To protect everyone in the Ark, Nikkes...\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_boomsday_intermission_01_29","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_boomsday_intermission_01_29","text":"a video was projected onto the Ark's sky display, the Dome of Eternity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":n